er Crossbody Purse, Vintage Slouchy ", "t": "VERY MUCH NOT LEATHER!! \n\nAlso I purchased this from a shop that was supposedly and supposed to be in the United States and when I asked the seller why it was taken so long for the shipping to get here and why the shipping date kept changing she admitted to saying that it would be more accurate when the shipping hit th"}, {"r": 4, "shop": "NyanyaStoreShop", "item": "Bali Rattan Bag, Handwoven Crossbody Purse, Natural Woven Shoulder Bag", "t": "Cute little crossbody for the summer."}, {"r": 3, "shop": "NyanyaStoreShop", "item": "Boho Hobo Shoulder Bag, Soft Leather Crossbody Purse, Vintage Slouchy ", "t": "The bag looks ok and the strap is nice, the fitting on the strap are plastic and I’m not confident they would support any weight in the bag! There are no inside pockets and the lining is loose, will easily catch in zip, the bag was half price but I would rather pay more for a bag I could use."}, {"r": 3, "shop": "NyanyaStoreShop", "item": "Boho Hobo Shoulder Bag, Soft Leather Crossbody Purse, Vintage Slouchy ", "t": "The strap is very pretty, but the metal hooks and rings to attach it are very cheap looking, and the purse material itself is quite cheap looking. The inside of the purse has no pockets or storage compartments whatsoever. All in all, not worth the price. Unfortunately Etsy‘s service is not comparable to Amazon, you mus"}, {"r": 2, "shop": "NyanyaStoreShop", "item": "Boho Hobo Shoulder Bag, Soft Leather Crossbody Purse, Vintage Slouchy ", "t": "Not what I was expecting, the quality isn't the best."}, {"r": 1, "shop": "ElynMinimal", "item": "Raffia Tote Bag with Leather Straps, Handwoven Straw Shoulder Handbag,", "t": "WHAT A SCAM! Don't be fooled.  I highly doubt this is actually the seller she claims to be.  Likely a cheap production warehouse in China.  My item arrived from China with cheaply made with plastic handles, not leather as described on the item page when I ordered.  When I asked for assistance, this seller initially agr"}, {"r": 1, "shop": "ElynMinimal", "item": "Raffia Woven Tote Bag, Handwoven Straw Handbag, Elegant Beach Vacation", "t": "I still have not received this order. I’ll update when I receive it. The shipping takes terribly long."}], "nrev": 93, "nlist": 2535}